# The recordings the tests read, relative to RBR_RECORDINGS: scripts/pack-test-data.sh packs these. A test that reads
# another recording adds it here, and the next release carries it; with RBR_RECORDINGS set, a missing one fails.
# rsf/: the RSF sessions scripts/gate.sh runs, without the car packs' and the game's files (session.bin packed through
# harness/session.py --strip; no files/, and setup.lsp only where it is the player's saved setup): rsf_compare.py takes
# those from RBR_RSF, checked against the session's sha256.
